# Kazakh–Russian Machine Translation Pipeline

This repository contains code for training and evaluating a machine translation model between Kazakh and Russian using LaBSE filtering and the M2M100 model.

## 🛠️ Setup

Make sure you have all dependencies installed (e.g. `transformers`, `datasets`, `evaluate`, `torch`, `polars`, `tqdm`).

## 🧱 Build & Run

```bash
make build
make run
